{"steam_appid":887450,"steam_name":"Tunche","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/887450/354047/bd0ba58fc51e3533158252b25d0371f3cc56a643/1750593786/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1615749867","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256825857/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1615749867","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/ss_69587fcde5983e259d2f3786b6e33a5230c54f8f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1721399704","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/ss_6c01af784b7dd1b11cf8461e2d5320f073450776.1920x1080.jpg?t=1721399704","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/ss_1b02fdc94d57a296435e47c4926c286b4ce7933f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1721399704","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/ss_70bacbd955acd0e5e1a45a7d29df0198666cc256.1920x1080.jpg?t=1721399704","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/ss_7b561adb43dadbff21390c8cfcd27c21d42f20f3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1721399704"],"about_the_game":"<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE BREATHTAKING AMAZONIAN FORESTS</h2></strong><br>Tunche is a charming, hand-drawn beat'em up hack and slash game with roguelike elements. Travel through 4 worlds, each filled with unique enemies, bosses, challenges, and stories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/extras/54a50d4e68b8c23806f0cc06100791b9.poster.avif?t=1721399704\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/extras/54a50d4e68b8c23806f0cc06100791b9.webm?t=1721399704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/extras/54a50d4e68b8c23806f0cc06100791b9.mp4?t=1721399704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY IN CO-OP</h2></strong><br>Play solo or join up to 3 of your friends in a local co-op session to uncover the mystery of the forest and the secrets of Tunche!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/extras/ddb0ab657bd61cd99a2e9dbc785b4994.poster.avif?t=1721399704\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/extras/ddb0ab657bd61cd99a2e9dbc785b4994.webm?t=1721399704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/extras/ddb0ab657bd61cd99a2e9dbc785b4994.mp4?t=1721399704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND YOUR OWN PLAYSTYLE</h2></strong><br>Choose one of the five unique characters: Rumi, the sorceress, Pancho the musician, Qaru the bird boy, Nayra the warrior &amp; Hat Kid from the highly acclaimed A Hat In Time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/extras/4db50319af5012892d8191e5bd6b433c.poster.avif?t=1721399704\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/extras/4db50319af5012892d8191e5bd6b433c.webm?t=1721399704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887450/extras/4db50319af5012892d8191e5bd6b433c.mp4?t=1721399704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE DIFFERENT SKILLS</h2></strong><br>To overcome the evil beasts of Amazonian forests you will have to learn the skills and ultimate abilities, that will take you further through the story with each playthrough.<br><br>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo E8400, 3.0GHz or AMD Athlon 64 X2 6000+, 3.0GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce 9600 GT or AMD HD 3870 512MB or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX®-compatible</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["LEAP Game Studios"],"publishers":["HypeTrain Digital"],"release_date":"2 Nov, 2021"}